    <briefdescription>
<para>The server sends a greeting into a newly established socket, regardless of the socket protocol. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This allows the connected client identify the protocol, server version and instance uuid. The greeting also contains a random salt which can be used to encode a password. </para>    </detaileddescription>
